Z||000000||Eric_PA||05-21-2001||08:50 PM||||Well I started tracing the wires in my wire harness for a 1990 Series I 3800. I have one little problem. The current prints that I am going by are not complete. I have about 8 wires that I have no clue where they go. Others I have traced back to the AC system, but still have those 8 wires left. I am using a Haynes manual and prints from an internet source. My problem is I don't have the pin outs for the ECM. Anyone out there that can help.<P>Thanks<BR>Eric||||reg||5
